  "shortDescription": {
    "en": "For roughly twenty-five years - essentially my entire adult life - I have kept returning to the same family of questions. Why do intelligent people build systems that later trap them? Why do institutions created to solve real problems become unable to see the problems created by their own solutions? Why does progress so often produce both freedom and dependence, clarity and blindness, resilience and fragility?",
    "fr": "Can’t See the Forest for the Trees est un livre d’ScriptaHub sur l’innovation, les organisations et le changement économique, conçu pour les lecteurs qui veulent examiner une idée plutôt que consommer un simple résumé.",
    "de": "Can’t See the Forest for the Trees ist ein Buch von ScriptaHub über Innovation, Organisationen und wirtschaftlichen Wandel, für Leserinnen und Leser, die eine Idee prüfen statt nur eine Zusammenfassung zu konsumieren.",
    "es": "Can’t See the Forest for the Trees es un libro de ScriptaHub sobre innovación, organizaciones y cambio económico, pensado para lectores que quieren examinar una idea y no solo consumir un resumen.",
    "pt": "Can’t See the Forest for the Trees é um livro da ScriptaHub sobre inovação, organizações e mudança econômica, feito para leitores que querem examinar uma ideia em vez de apenas consumir um resumo.",
    "it": "Can’t See the Forest for the Trees è un libro di ScriptaHub su innovazione, organizzazioni e cambiamento economico, pensato per chi vuole esaminare un’idea anziché consumare solo un riassunto.",
    "ro": "Can’t See the Forest for the Trees este o carte ScriptaHub despre inovare, organizații și schimbare economică, pentru cititori care vor să examineze o idee, nu doar să consume un rezumat.",
    "pl": "Can’t See the Forest for the Trees to książka ScriptaHub o innowacje, organizacje i zmianę gospodarczą, dla czytelników, którzy chcą zbadać ideę, a nie tylko przeczytać streszczenie."
  },
